[
  {
    "id": "default-0",
    "text": "且视他人之疑目如盏盏鬼火，大胆地去走你的夜路。",
    "author": "史铁生",
    "work": "《病隙碎笔》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-1",
    "text": "人的天职在于勇于探索真理。",
    "author": "哥白尼",
    "work": "",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-2",
    "text": "What's past is prologue.",
    "author": "William Shakespeare",
    "work": "The Tempest",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-3",
    "text": "This too shall pass.",
    "author": "波斯谚语",
    "work": "",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-4",
    "text": "愿乘长风破万里浪。",
    "author": "宗悫",
    "work": "",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-5",
    "text": "No need to hurry. No need to sparkle. No need to be anybody but oneself.",
    "author": "Virginia Woolf",
    "work": "The Diary of Virginia Woolf",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-6",
    "text": "我们一生不过是清醒地穿过梦境，每个人只不过是岁月的一个幽灵。",
    "author": "弗兰兹·卡夫卡",
    "work": "",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-7",
    "text": "我的肩上是风\r\n风上是闪烁的星群",
    "author": "北岛",
    "work": "《结局或开始——献给遇罗克》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-8",
    "text": "少日春怀似酒浓，插花走马醉千钟。",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "work": "《定风波·暮春漫兴》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-9",
    "text": "无论风暴将我带到什么样的岸边，我都将以主人的身份上岸。",
    "author": "昆图斯·贺拉斯·弗拉库斯",
    "work": "《颂歌集》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-10",
    "text": "所有的星星终将毁灭，可它们无畏地燃烧着。",
    "author": "埃迪特·索德格朗",
    "work": "《存在的凯旋》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-11",
    "text": "所谓无底深渊，下去，也是前程万里。",
    "author": "木心",
    "work": "《素履之往》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-12",
    "text": "虽然辛苦，我还是会选择那种滚烫的人生。",
    "author": "北野武",
    "work": "《北野武的小酒馆》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-13",
    "text": "休对故人思故国，且将新火试新茶。诗酒趁年华。",
    "author": "苏轼",
    "work": "《望江南·超然台作》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-14",
    "text": "After all, tomorrow is another day.",
    "author": "Margaret Mitchell",
    "work": "Gone with the Wind",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-15",
    "text": "人独自行过生命，蒙受玷污，承担罪过，痛饮苦酒，寻觅出路。",
    "author": "赫尔曼·黑塞",
    "work": "《悉达多》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-16",
    "text": "以心灵的秩序对抗世界的复杂性。",
    "author": "伊塔洛·卡尔维诺",
    "work": "《为什么读经典》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-18",
    "text": "你要到达自由的高处，你的灵魂渴慕星空。",
    "author": "弗里德里希·尼采",
    "work": "《查拉图斯特拉如是说》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-19",
    "text": "请让我独自行事，自由做梦，任凭明天对我裁决。",
    "author": "纪伯伦",
    "work": "《泪与笑·致非难者》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-20",
    "text": "自由一生，是我全部的野心。",
    "author": "西班牙谚语",
    "work": "",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-21",
    "text": "而世上鲜花会盛开，壮丽不朽的事物会接踵而来。",
    "author": "约翰·济慈",
    "work": "《厌于世人的迷信而作》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-22",
    "text": "我身体里的火车从来不会错轨\n 所以允许大雪，风暴，泥石流和荒谬",
    "author": "余秀华",
    "work": "《我身体里也有一列火车》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-23",
    "text": "目击众神死亡的草原上野花一片\n远在远方的风比远方更远",
    "author": "海子",
    "work": "《九月》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "default-24",
    "text": "我们所过的每个平凡的日常，也许就是连续发生的奇迹。",
    "author": "新井圭一",
    "work": "《日常》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  },
  {
    "id": "52fe0a3e-bc6a-4388-8dca-ecee5ea9bbf7",
    "text": "对未来的真正慷慨，是把一切献给现在。",
    "author": "阿尔贝·加缪",
    "work": "《反抗者》",
    "translator": "",
    "source": "",
    "note": "",
    "custom": false
  }
]
